{
  "id": 514772214,
  "iid": 26046,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "x509if: fix null-pointer dereference on invalid nested RDN",
  "description": "A RDN nested within a RDN is malformed and creates a nested call to\n`dissect_x509if_RelativeDistinguishedName`. The inner dissection resets\n`last_rdn_buf` to NULL, causing a NULL-pointer deref in the outer call.\n\nFix this by gracefully handling the outcome. `last_dn_buf` seems\nsimilar, but is unaffected as it doesn't reset to NULL after dissection.\n\nFixes #21469\n\nFixes: v4.1.0rc0-821-g59ee5247dc (\"X509IF: Fix string truncation\")",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2026-08-03T23:56:40.089Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-04T00:32:33.193Z",
